%SIXMD 1
# @?HEXDUMP - PRINT FILE WORDS IN OCTAL

## @?OPERANDS

### @?FILE ...
ONE OR MORE WORD FILES TO DUMP.

## DESCRIPTION

HEXDUMP READS EACH FILE AS 36-BIT WORDS AND PRINTS A SIX-DIGIT WORD OFFSET
AND TWELVE-DIGIT OCTAL VALUE FOR EVERY WORD.
USAGE IS 'HEXDUMP FILE ...'.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - SUCCESS
### @?1 - OPERATION FAILED OR CONDITION FALSE
### @?2 - INVALID USAGE WHEN APPLICABLE
